  "bio": "Sergey Erus is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Voronezh, Russia, specializing in tribal, Japanese, and new school styles. Known for his professionalism, Sergey dedicates himself to providing an exceptional and precise tattooing experience, ensuring that each client's artistic vision is brought to life with meticulous attention to detail. His work portfolio, available via @drugoyerus, showcases the depth of his talent and the breadth of his expertise in the craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Voronezh, Central Federal District, Russia\n\nСергей Ерус",
